以不会追究？“思思”告诉记者：“其实我们也会在网上分享照片，所以真的不会介意，哪怕（照片）不美。” 4月18日，记者也致电该剧的播放平台客服询问此事，工作人员表示，观众如果遇到这种情况，可以通过平台客服稍后发送的链接，提供相应的界面图片，并提供肖像出现的时间在几分几秒等信息，向在线客服登记，并告知诉求，进行下一步的处理。女生发现自己出现在热播剧中，有2秒镜头还配了字幕…"},"attached_info":"CkoIjoycy9PKtq54EAMaCTExNDU5NzQxNSDL2JPABjAAOPoCQBtyEzE4OTczOTAzMDAxODk2NTA5OTF4AKoBCWJpbGxib2FyZNIBAA==","detail_text":"79 万热度","trend":0,"debut":false,"children":[{"type":"answer","thumbnail":"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-b155436e150b7c34a0d945a473c48934_1440w.jpg"}]},{"type":"hot_list_feed","style_type":"1","id":"28_1745400124.47238","card_id":"Q_23506156","target":{"id":23506156,"title":"印钞厂如何防范印钞工人偷偷拿钱？","url":"https://api.zhihu.com/questions/23506156","type":"question","created":1398146985,"answer_count":27,"follower_count":69,"author":{"type":"people","user_type":"people","id":"0","url_token":"","url":"","name":"用户","headline":"","avatar_url":"https://pica.zhimg.com/aadd7b895_s.jpg"},"bound_topic_ids":[3858,49278],"comment_count":0,"is_following":false,"excerpt":""},"attached_info":"CjwIjoycy9PKtq54EAMaBzE1ODM3OTkgqY/YmgUwADhFQBxyCDIzNTA2MTU2eACqAQliaWxsYm9hcmTSAQA=","detail_text":"78 万热度","trend":0,"debut":false,"children":[{"type":"answer","thumbnail":"https://pic3.zhimg.com/50/v2-145e8812213049ca3e87500bf5d13d12_b.jpg"}]},{"type":"hot_list_feed","style_type":"1","id":"29_1745400124.47490","card_id":"Q_1898018026676254172","card_label":{"type":"new","icon":"https://pic2.zhimg.com/80/v2-a4b0b52b561281109c51e4957cb20130_1440w.png","night_icon":"https://pic3.zhimg.com/80/v2-10ef6526c602e55a8c606e46aa0cc586_1440w.png"},"target":{"id":1898018026676254200,"title":"你用过最「长寿」的电子产品是什么？","url":"https://api.zhihu.com/questions/1898018026676254172","type":"question","created":1745302761,"answer_count":28,"follower_count":39,"author":{"type":"people","user_type":"people","id":"0","url_token":"","url":"","name":"用户","headline":"","avatar_url":"https://pica.zhimg.com/aadd7b895_s.jpg"},"bound_topic_ids":[488,3132,12810,16140,3945058],"comment_count":0,"is_following":false,"e